OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fsome early evening sunshine at first
OL,7,Fbut cloud thickening from the west
OL,8,Flate evening, with an area of rain
OL,9,Fspreading to all overnight, as winds
OL,10,Fback southerly and increase fresh to
OL,11,Fstrong.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FWet, windy start with the
OL,14,Fchance of some heavier outbreaks.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunday
OL,17,Fmainly dry with light winds and
OL,18,Flengthy sunny spells. Monday starting
OL,19,Fmainly dry, soon turning wet and
OL,20,Foccasionally windy. Tuesday drier and
OL,21,Fbrighter in east, some showers in west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
